---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tsugi | san serif" description="Japanese sentence flashcards for intermediate and advanced learners. Tsugi uses AI-powered n+1 selection, local text analysis, audio, furigana, dictionary lookup, and adaptive spaced repetition to make authentic Japanese easier to study.">
	<main class="wrapper">

		<section class="app-hero">

			<div class="video-container">
				<div class="video-glow"></div>
				<div class="media-placeholder hero-placeholder">Hero video — pending</div>
			</div>

			<div class="app-intro">
				<h1>Tsugi</h1>
				<p class="description">
					Japanese flashcards built around real sentences, for learners who've outgrown isolated word lists. Tsugi finds the next useful thing to learn, explains it in context, and brings it back for review at the right time.
				</p>

				<a href="https://apps.apple.com/au/app/tsugi-japanese-vocab-mining/id1546470961" class="app-store-link">
					<img src="/images/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" class="badge-svg" />
				</a>
			</div>

		</section>

		<div class="divider"></div>

		<section class="details-grid">

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/tsugi-word.png" alt="Tsugi Japanese sentence flashcard" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
			    <h3>Real Japanese, One Step Ahead</h3>
			    <p>Learn from complete Japanese sentences instead of isolated word lists. Tsugi keeps each new card just beyond your current level, so every review adds something useful without becoming overwhelming.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/tsugi-furigana.png" alt="Tsugi interactive furigana and audio controls" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
				<h3>Read, Listen, Recall</h3>
				<p>Interactive furigana, native audio, and simple recall controls turn every sentence into focused reading and listening practice, with help available when you need it.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/tsugi-stats.png" alt="Tsugi learning progress and retention statistics" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
				<h3>See What’s Sticking</h3>
				<p>Track review momentum, retention, active sentences, and mastery across memory tiers, so you can see your Japanese vocabulary growing over time.</p>
			</div>

		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.wrapper {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}

	h1, p {
		margin-block: 0;
	}

	.app-hero {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 30px;
		gap: 24px;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	.video-container {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 480px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: 0;
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
		background: transparent !important;
	}

	.video-container:hover {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(-12px);
	}

	.video-glow {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.media-placeholder {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: #fafafa;
		color: #bbb;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-placeholder {
		aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
		max-height: 520px;
	}

	.app-intro {
		z-index: 2;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		color: #111;
	}

	.description {
		max-width: 580px;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.app-store-link {
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.app-store-link:hover { transform: scale(1.04) translateY(-4px); }

	.badge-svg {
		height: 52px;
		width: auto;
		display: block;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
	}

	.divider {
		height: 1px;
		background: #ffffff;
		margin: 30px 0;
	}

	.details-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 60px;
		margin-bottom: 120px;
	}

	.detail-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.floating-container {
		width: 100%;
		height: 300px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}

	.modular-image {
		width: 200px;
		height: 300px;
		object-fit: contain;
		border-radius: 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
		transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.detail-card:hover .modular-image {
		transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-10px);
	}

	.detail-card:first-child .modular-image {
		width: 300px;
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: #111;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.detail-card p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 260px;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.details-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 40px;
		}
		h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
	}
</style>
